   "fix": "Make `k` an explicit leading argument on the exposed roadmap targets: `def classSum (k : Type*) [Semiring k] (C : ConjClasses G)` and `theorem classSum_mem_center (k : Type*) [CommSemiring k] (C : ConjClasses G)`, matching the roadmap and removing all `(k := k)`.",
